{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags-and-load-shedding","title":"特性开关与负载卸载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/feature-flags-and-load-shedding","wordCount":2036,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"特性开关与负载卸载\">特性开关与负载卸载</h1><p>凌晨三点接到告警，一个第三方风控接口开始返回 5 秒级超时，连锁拖垮了整个下单链路——这时你需要的不是「改代码、过 CI、灰度发布」这条要走二十分钟的路，而是一个能在五秒内拨动的开关，把那个风控调用从「硬依赖」变成「软依赖」直接跳过。特性开关（feature flag）和负载卸载（load shedding）正是优雅降级里这两类「运行时杠杆」：前者让你<strong>临时关掉某个功能</strong>，后者让你<strong>临时少干一些活</strong>。两者都不修复故障，而是在修复到位之前把系统稳住，把损失收敛在最小爆炸半径里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把降级杠杆按「触发方式」和「作用对象」分类，能看清特性开关与负载卸载的分工。特性开关是<strong>人/规则驱动、按功能维度</strong>关闭：运维在事故中手动拉闸（kill switch），或由配置规则自动把某条调用链切到 fallback。负载卸载是<strong>指标驱动、按请求维度</strong>拒绝：当队列深度、CPU、尾延迟越过阈值，系统主动丢弃一部分请求，优先保住高优先级流量的延迟保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[请求进入] --&gt; B{特性开关&lt;br/&gt;该功能是否启用}&#10;  B --&gt;|关闭 kill switch| F[走 fallback&lt;br/&gt;或直接返回降级结果]&#10;  B --&gt;|启用| C{负载卸载&lt;br/&gt;系统是否过载}&#10;  C --&gt;|过载且低优先级| D[拒绝 429&lt;br/&gt;shed lower priority]&#10;  C --&gt;|过载但高优先级| E[放行核心流量]&#10;  C --&gt;|未过载| E&#10;  E --&gt; G[正常处理]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[请求进入] --&gt; B{特性开关&lt;br/&gt;该功能是否启用}\n  B --&gt;|关闭 kill switch| F[走 fallback&lt;br/&gt;或直接返回降级结果]\n  B --&gt;|启用| C{负载卸载&lt;br/&gt;系统是否过载}\n  C --&gt;|过载且低优先级| D[拒绝 429&lt;br/&gt;shed lower priority]\n  C --&gt;|过载但高优先级| E[放行核心流量]\n  C --&gt;|未过载| E\n  E --&gt; G[正常处理]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>两类杠杆的边界与适用场景对照如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>特性开关 / Kill Switch</th>\n<th>负载卸载 / Load Shedding</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发源</td>\n<td>人工拉闸或配置规则</td>\n<td>实时指标（队列、CPU、尾延迟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用粒度</td>\n<td>功能 / 集成 / 代码路径</td>\n<td>单个请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型动作</td>\n<td>跳过调用、切 fallback、关功能</td>\n<td>拒绝、延后、降质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生效速度</td>\n<td>秒级（无需发布）</td>\n<td>自动、毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与背压区别</td>\n<td>不涉及流控</td>\n<td>主动丢请求，不是让客户端放慢（<a href=\"https://sreschool.com/blog/comprehensive-tutorial-on-load-shedding-in-site-reliability-engineering/\">SRE School</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高价值目标</td>\n<td>支付、鉴权、第三方集成、新上线功能（<a href=\"https://upstat.io/blog/feature-flags-kill-switches\">Upstat</a>）</td>\n<td>非核心、低优先级、低层级用户的请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特性开关作为运行时杠杆-featureops\">特性开关作为运行时杠杆：FeatureOps</h2><p>特性开关早年只是「灰度发布开关」，2026 年的主流叙事是 <strong>FeatureOps</strong>——把开关当成生产环境的运维控制面。Unleash 在《Graceful degradation in practice》里给出的定位很准：熔断、超时、舱壁、重试退避、负载卸载这些韧性模式负责「检测和反应」，而 FeatureOps 是「让你在运行时动态控制这些行为」的那一层，可以即时切换 fallback 路径、关闭有风险的集成、瞬间卸掉负载（<a href=\"https://www.getunleash.io/blog/graceful-degradation-featureops-resilience\">Unleash</a>）。</p>\n<p>关键在于一句话：<strong>优雅降级要求在「来不及发布」的那一刻就有动作</strong>。LaunchDarkly 把这类开关称作 operational flag（运营开关），区别于做实验的 release flag——它们的存在意义就是熔断器、过载降级和运行时配置变更的紧急断路（<a href=\"https://launchdarkly.com/blog/what-are-feature-flags/\">LaunchDarkly</a>）。Upstat 的实践建议把 kill switch 优先装在「爆炸半径大」的组件上：支付处理、身份认证、第三方集成、资源密集型操作，以及刚上线的新功能；相比重新发一个修复版本，直接关掉故障组件能把 MTTR（平均恢复时间）大幅压低（<a href=\"https://upstat.io/blog/feature-flags-kill-switches\">Upstat</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个典型的 kill switch 包裹模式，核心是「开关判断 + fallback + 失败安全默认值」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def get_risk_score(order):&#10;    # 开关默认值必须是「故障安全」的一侧：&#10;    # 拿不到配置时也应能降级，而不是阻塞下单&#10;    if not flags.enabled(&quot;risk_check_enabled&quot;, default=False):&#10;        return RiskScore.bypass(reason=&quot;kill_switch_off&quot;)&#10;    try:&#10;        return risk_service.evaluate(order, timeout=0.3)&#10;    except (Timeout, ServiceError):&#10;        # 软依赖化：第三方挂了不阻塞核心链路&#10;        return RiskScore.degraded(reason=&quot;risk_service_unavailable&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_risk_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 开关默认值必须是「故障安全」的一侧：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 拿不到配置时也应能降级，而不是阻塞下单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flags.enabled(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"risk_check_enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RiskScore.bypass(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kill_switch_off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> risk_service.evaluate(order, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Timeout, ServiceError):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 软依赖化：第三方挂了不阻塞核心链路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RiskScore.degraded(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"risk_service_unavailable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意两处设计：开关的 <code>default</code> 取「关闭」是因为配置中心本身也可能不可用，此时要保证系统仍能服务而非死等；<code>except</code> 分支把硬依赖转成软依赖，呼应了 AWS Well-Architected 的 REL05-BP01——把可降级的硬依赖转化为软依赖（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/rel_mitigate_interaction_failure_graceful_degradation.html\">AWS</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负载卸载-从静态阈值到自适应控制\">负载卸载：从静态阈值到自适应控制</h2><p>负载卸载的本质是「在系统满载时主动拒绝、延后或降质一部分请求，以保住整体的健康和延迟保证」，它和背压的差别在于背压试图让客户端放慢、而卸载直接拒掉（<a href=\"https://sreschool.com/blog/comprehensive-tutorial-on-load-shedding-in-site-reliability-engineering/\">SRE School</a>）。最朴素的实现是静态阈值——CPU 超过 80% 就开始拒绝——但静态阈值在动态环境里会剧烈震荡：一拒就降载、一降载又放开、再过载，来回抖动。</p>\n<p>2026 年公认更优的是<strong>自适应算法</strong>。两条主流路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CoDel（受控延迟）</strong>：不看 CPU，盯请求在队列里待了多久。在一个测量窗口（如 100ms）内，若请求的排队时延持续超过目标阈值（如 5ms），就开始丢弃。它直接对准「延迟」这个用户能感知的指标，对突发流量更稳健（<a href=\"https://codelit.io/blog/load-shedding-patterns\">Codelit</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>PID 控制器</strong>：Uber 的 Cinnamon 库用改良的 TCP-Vegas 估算服务容量，再用 PID（比例-积分-微分）控制器调节卸载率，让目标指标（CPU/延迟/队列深度）稳定在区间内，避免简单阈值的震荡（<a href=\"https://www.uber.com/blog/cinnamon-using-century-old-tech-to-build-a-mean-load-shedder/\">Uber</a>、<a href=\"https://www.infoq.com/news/2024/02/uber-dynamic-load-shedding/\">InfoQ</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PID 控制器的直觉是：当前误差（比例项）、累积误差（积分项）、误差变化趋势（微分项）三者加权决定调整量。设目标排队时延为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、实测为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(t) = L(t) - L_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则卸载率的调整量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(t) = K_p \\, e(t) + K_i \\int_0^t e(\\tau)\\, d\\tau + K_d \\frac{d e(t)}{dt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4554em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>积分项消除稳态偏差、微分项抑制超调，这正是它比「过线就拒」平滑的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  M[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;队列时延/CPU/并发] --&gt; N[计算误差 e=L-Ltarget]&#10;  N --&gt; O[PID 控制器&lt;br/&gt;Kp·e + Ki·积分 + Kd·微分]&#10;  O --&gt; P[输出目标卸载率]&#10;  P --&gt; Q{对每个请求&lt;br/&gt;按优先级与卸载率判定}&#10;  Q --&gt;|保留| R[处理]&#10;  Q --&gt;|卸载| S[拒绝 429 + Retry-After]&#10;  R --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  M[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;队列时延/CPU/并发] --&gt; N[计算误差 e=L-Ltarget]\n  N --&gt; O[PID 控制器&lt;br/&gt;Kp·e + Ki·积分 + Kd·微分]\n  O --&gt; P[输出目标卸载率]\n  P --&gt; Q{对每个请求&lt;br/&gt;按优先级与卸载率判定}\n  Q --&gt;|保留| R[处理]\n  Q --&gt;|卸载| S[拒绝 429 + Retry-After]\n  R --&gt; M</pre><h2 id=\"优先级卸载-netflix-的工程化落地\">优先级卸载：Netflix 的工程化落地</h2><p>光会「丢请求」还不够，关键是<strong>丢对的请求</strong>。Netflix 2024 年起把这件事工程化为「服务级优先级卸载」（service-level prioritized load shedding），2025 年进一步扩展，其平台围绕三根支柱：优先级分配、中心化配置、自动化校验（<a href=\"https://netflixtechblog.com/enhancing-netflix-reliability-with-service-level-prioritized-load-shedding-e735e6ce8f7d\">Netflix TechBlog</a>、<a href=\"https://www.infoq.com/news/2025/11/netflix-prioritized-loadshedding/\">InfoQ</a>）。</p>\n<p>它的核心机制是：请求在入口早期就根据业务关键性定级（如通过 request header），并把优先级沿调用链向下游透传；各集群聚合自身的利用率指标（CPU、延迟、并发），自动生成一个「利用率 × 优先级 → 拒绝概率」的卸载函数。换句话说，越接近过载、且优先级越低的请求，被拒概率越高；而播放、鉴权这类核心请求即便系统吃紧也尽量放行。这与 Google 在 Borg/Stubby 里用反馈控制环动态调整请求速率、压住尾延迟的思路同源（<a href=\"https://www.infoq.com/articles/overload-protection-platform-engineering/\">InfoQ</a>）。</p>\n<p>Netflix 的另一思路是「降质而非拒绝」：与其丢请求，不如临时降低服务质量——减少可用功能、或把确定性数据库查询换成近似查询，这样仍能服务所有请求而不丢任何一个（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/rel_mitigate_interaction_failure_graceful_degradation.html\">AWS Reliability Pillar</a>）。这恰好把特性开关和负载卸载缝在了一起：用开关把「全功能模式」切到「精简模式」，本身就是一种粒度更粗的卸载。</p>\n<p>不同卸载策略的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拒绝（reject）</td>\n<td>部分请求失败 / 429</td>\n<td>明确不可降质的写操作</td>\n<td>部分用户被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延后（defer）</td>\n<td>变慢但最终成功</td>\n<td>可异步化的任务</td>\n<td>队列与时延上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降质（degrade）</td>\n<td>功能变少 / 数据变粗</td>\n<td>推荐、搜索、个性化</td>\n<td>体验下降但全员可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>特性开关与负载卸载是优雅降级里互补的两根运行时杠杆，记住以下要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>特性开关 = 人/规则驱动、按功能拉闸</strong>；负载卸载 = <strong>指标驱动、按请求拒绝</strong>。前者秒级且无需发布，后者自动且毫秒级。</li>\n<li>Kill switch 优先保护爆炸半径大的组件（支付、鉴权、第三方、新功能），用 fallback + 故障安全默认值把硬依赖转成软依赖（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/rel_mitigate_interaction_failure_graceful_degradation.html\">AWS REL05-BP01</a>）。</li>\n<li>负载卸载用<strong>自适应算法（CoDel / PID）</strong> 取代静态阈值，避免震荡；CoDel 盯排队时延、PID 用三项反馈平滑调节（<a href=\"https://www.uber.com/blog/cinnamon-using-century-old-tech-to-build-a-mean-load-shedder/\">Uber Cinnamon</a>）。</li>\n<li>丢请求要<strong>丢对的</strong>：在入口按业务关键性定级、向下游透传，用「利用率 × 优先级 → 拒绝概率」函数优先保住核心流量（<a href=\"https://netflixtechblog.com/enhancing-netflix-reliability-with-service-level-prioritized-load-shedding-e735e6ce8f7d\">Netflix TechBlog</a>）。</li>\n<li>「降质而非拒绝」往往是更优解——用开关把全功能切到精简模式，既是降级也是粗粒度卸载，让所有用户都还能用。</li>\n<li>2026 年的统一叙事是 <strong>FeatureOps</strong>：把开关当成生产控制面，让熔断、卸载、fallback 都能在运行时被即时操控（<a href=\"https://www.getunleash.io/blog/graceful-degradation-featureops-resilience\">Unleash</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特性开关与负载卸载","id":"特性开关与负载卸载"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"特性开关作为运行时杠杆：FeatureOps","id":"特性开关作为运行时杠杆-featureops"},{"level":2,"text":"负载卸载：从静态阈值到自适应控制","id":"负载卸载-从静态阈值到自适应控制"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级卸载：Netflix 的工程化落地","id":"优先级卸载-netflix-的工程化落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"回退与默认值策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/fallback-and-default-strategies"},"next":{"title":"背压的基本原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/backpressure-fundamentals"}}